        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 1,
        "content": [
          "Greek has its own prefixes, separate",
          "from Latin's, and just as regular.",
          "",
          "peri-  = around     dia- = across",
          "epi-   = upon       syn- = together",
          "hypo-  = under      hyper- = over",
          "ana-   = up, back   cata- = down",
          "",
          "Chain one onto a root and the sense",
          "builds logically:",
          "",
          "dia (across) + gnosis (knowledge)",
          "= diagnosis — knowledge gained by",
          "looking all the way through a case.",
          "",
          "Watch for these prefixes everywhere",
          "from here on. They repeat constantly."
        ],
